 vi\\u00ean:\&quot;,null,null],\&quot;localized_label_image\&quot;:[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\&quot;default_label\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;section_type\&quot;:\&quot;text_section\&quot;,\&quot;unique_id\&quot;:84427,\&quot;internal_section_data\&quot;:null,\&quot;text_section_contents\&quot;:[\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]The Play List [\\\/b]\\nUnlimited access to an unrivaled collection of EA\\u2019s fan-favorite franchises and top titles.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Game Trials[\\\/b]\\nTry select new release titles for up to 10 hours and discover your next favorite game.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Member Rewards[\\\/b]\\nUnlock member rewards in the hottest EA titles each month.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]10% Discount[\\\/b]\\nSave 10% off EA digital purchases\\u2014including game downloads, points packs, and DLC.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Belohnen Sie sich f\\u00fcr Ihr Engagement[\\\/b]\\nSchalten Sie exklusive Belohnungen und exklusive Inhalte f\\u00fcr Mitglieder frei.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Immer neue Favoriten[\\\/b]\\nErhalten Sie sofortigen Zugriff auf die beliebtesten Spiele von EA.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Spielen Sie neue Titel zur Probe[\\\/b]\\nSpielen Sie bis zu 10 Stunden lang ausgew\\u00e4hlte, neu ver\\u00f6ffentlichte EA-Spiele.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Erhalten Sie mehr f\\u00fcr weniger[\\\/b]\\nSparen Sie 10\\u00a0% Rabatt auf digitale EA-K\\u00e4ufe, von Vollversionen bis zu Zusatzinhalten.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Votre implication est r\\u00e9compens\\u00e9e[\\\/b]\\nD\\u00e9bloquez des r\\u00e9compenses exclusives et du contenu r\\u00e9serv\\u00e9 aux membres.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Vous avez toujours plus de jeux \\u00e0 d\\u00e9couvrir[\\\/b]\\nProfitez d'un acc\\u00e8s instantan\\u00e9 \\u00e0 une collection des jeux les plus populaires d'EA.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Essayez un nouveau jeu[\\\/b]\\nJouez \\u00e0 une s\\u00e9lection de nouveaut\\u00e9s EA pendant 10\\u00a0heures.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Obtenez plus en \\u00e9conomisant plus[\\\/b]\\n\\u00c9conomisez 10\\u00a0% sur vos achats num\\u00e9riques, des jeux complets au contenu t\\u00e9l\\u00e9chargeable.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Premia la tua passione[\\\/b]\\nSblocca ricompense esclusive e contenuti riservati ai membri.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]C'\\u00e8 sempre di pi\\u00f9 da giocare[\\\/b]\\nOttieni accesso immediato a una collezione dei titoli EA pi\\u00f9 amati.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Prova qualcosa di nuovo[\\\/b]\\nGioca fino a 10 ore a nuovi titoli EA selezionati.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Ottieni di pi\\u00f9 spendendo di meno[\\\/b]\\nRisparmia il 10% sugli acquisti digitali di prodotti EA, da giochi completi a DLC.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]\\ub0b4 \\ud5cc\\uc2e0\\uc5d0 \\ub300\\ud55c \\ubcf4\\uc0c1[\\\/b]\\n\\ub3c5\\uc810 \\ubcf4\\uc0c1\\uacfc \\uba64\\ubc84 \\uc804\\uc6a9 \\ucf58\\ud150\\uce20\\ub97c \\uc7a0\\uae08 \\ud574\\uc81c\\ud558\\uc138\\uc694.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]\\ud56d\\uc0c1 \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774\\ud560 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc740 \\ub354 \\ub9ce\\uc774 \\ub0a8\\uc544\\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4![\\\/b]\\nEA\\uc758 \\uac00\\uc7a5 \\uc778\\uae30 \\uc788\\ub294 \\uac8c\\uc784 \\ubaa8\\uc74c\\uc744 \\uc989\\uc2dc \\uc774\\uc6a9\\ud558\\uc138\\uc694.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]\\uc0c8\\ub85c\\uc6b4 \\uac8c\\uc784 \\uccb4\\ud5d8\\ud558\\uae30[\\\/b]\\n\\uc5c4\\uc120\\ub41c \\uc2e0\\uc791 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc744 \\ucd5c\\ub300 10\\uc2dc\\uac04 \\ub3d9\\uc548 \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774\\ud558\\uc138\\uc694.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]\\ub354 \\ub9ce\\uc740 \\uac83\\uc744 \\ub354 \\uc800\\ub834\\ud558\\uac8c \\uad6c\\ub9e4\\ud558\\uc138\\uc694[\\\/b]\\n\\uc815\\uc2dd \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc5d0\\uc11c DLC\\uae4c\\uc9c0, EA \\ub514\\uc9c0\\ud138 \\uad6c\\ub9e4 \\uc2dc 10% \\ud560\\uc778 \\ud61c\\ud0dd\\uc744 \\ubc1b\\uc73c\\uc138\\uc694.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Premia tu compromiso[\\\/b]\\nDesbloquea recompensas exclusivas y contenido de EA exclusivo para miembros.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Siempre habr\\u00e1 algo a lo que jugar[\\\/b]\\nT\\u00e9n acceso inmediato a una colecci\\u00f3n con los mejores juegos de EA.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Prueba algo nuevo[\\\/b]\\nJuega a nuevos lanzamientos hasta un m\\u00e1ximo de 10 horas.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Consigue m\\u00e1s por menos[\\\/b]\\nAhorra un 10 % en compras digitales de EA, desde juegos completos hasta DLC.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]\\u5956\\u52b1\\u60a8\\u7684\\u5949\\u732e[\\\/b]\\n\\u89e3\\u9501\\u4e13\\u5c5e\\u5956\\u52b1\\u4f1a\\u545