4c10%\\u30aa\\u30d5\\uff01[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Recompensa a tua dedica\\u00e7\\u00e3o[\\\/b]\\nDesbloqueia recompensas exclusivas e conte\\u00fado apenas para membros.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]H\\u00e1 sempre algo mais para jogar[\\\/b]\\nObt\\u00e9m acesso imediato \\u00e0 cole\\u00e7\\u00e3o de jogos mais populares do EA.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Experimenta algo novo[\\\/b]\\nJoga novos lan\\u00e7amentos da EA at\\u00e9 10 horas no m\\u00e1ximo.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Obt\\u00e9m mais por menos[\\\/b]\\nPoupa 10% em compras digitais da EA, desde jogos completos at\\u00e9 DLCs.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Nagrod\\u017a swoje zaanga\\u017cowanie[\\\/b]\\nOdblokuj wyj\\u0105tkowe nagrody i zawarto\\u015b\\u0107 EA dost\\u0119pn\\u0105 tylko dla abonent\\u00f3w.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Zawsze b\\u0119dziesz mie\\u0107 w co gra\\u0107[\\\/b]\\nZyskaj natychmiastowy dost\\u0119p do kolekcji najlepszych gier EA.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Wypr\\u00f3buj co\\u015b nowego[\\\/b]\\nGraj w nowo opublikowane gry EA nawet przez 10 godzin.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Zdob\\u0105d\\u017a wi\\u0119cej za mniej[\\\/b]\\nP\\u0142a\\u0107 10% mniej za produkty cyfrowe EA, od pe\\u0142nych gier po pakiety DLC.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Bel\\u00f8n dit engagement[\\\/b]\\nL\\u00e5s op for eksklusive bel\\u00f8nninger og indhold kun for medlemmer.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Der er altid mere at spille[\\\/b]\\nF\\u00e5 \\u00f8jeblikkelig adgang til en samling af EA's mest popul\\u00e6re spil.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Pr\\u00f8v noget nyt[\\\/b]\\nSpil udvalgte kommende EA-spil i op til 10 timer.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]F\\u00e5 mere for mindre[\\\/b]\\nSpar 10 % p\\u00e5 digitale EA-k\\u00f8b fra fulde spil til DLC.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Je toewijding beloond[\\\/b]\\nOntgrendel exclusieve beloningen en inhoud alleen voor leden.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Er is altijd meer om te spelen[\\\/b]\\nKrijg direct toegang tot een selectie van de populairste EA-spellen.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Probeer eens iets nieuws[\\\/b]\\nSpeel tot 10 uur lang een select aantal nieuwe EA-spellen.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Krijg meer voor minder[\\\/b]\\nBespaar 10% op digitale EA-aankopen, van volledige spellen tot DLC.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Palkinto j\\u00e4senyydest\\u00e4[\\\/b]\\nAvaa eksklusiivisia palkintoja ja vain j\\u00e4senille tarkoitettua sis\\u00e4lt\\u00f6\\u00e4.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Aina l\\u00f6ytyy lis\\u00e4\\u00e4 pelattavaa[\\\/b]\\nHanki v\\u00e4litt\\u00f6m\\u00e4sti p\\u00e4\\u00e4sy kokoelmaan EA:n rakastetuimpia pelej\\u00e4.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Kokeile jotain uutta[\\\/b]\\nPelaa valikoituja juuri julkaistuja EA-pelej\\u00e4 jopa kymmenen tunnin ajan.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Enemm\\u00e4n edullisemmin[\\\/b]\\nS\\u00e4\\u00e4st\\u00e4 10 % EA:n digitaalisista ostoista aina pelien t\\u00e4ysversioista lis\\u00e4materiaaleihin.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Bel\\u00f8nn engasjementet ditt[\\\/b]\\nL\\u00e5s opp eksklusive bel\\u00f8nninger og innhold kun for medlemmer.[\\\/td]\\n[td][\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Det er alltid mer \\u00e5 spille[\\\/b]\\nF\\u00e5 umiddelbar tilgang til en samling av EAs mest popul\\u00e6re spill.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Pr\\u00f8v noe nytt[\\\/b]\\nSpill utvalgte nye EA-spill i opptil 10 timer.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]F\\u00e5 mer for mindre penger[\\\/b]\\nSpar 10 % p\\u00e5 digitale EA-kj\\u00f8p fra fullversjoner til nedlastbart innhold.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Bel\\u00f6nas f\\u00f6r din h\\u00e4ngivenhet[\\\/b]\\nL\\u00e5s upp exklusiva bel\\u00f6ningar och inneh\\u00e5ll enbart f\\u00f6r medlemmar.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Det finns alltid mer att spela[\\\/b]\\nF\\u00e5 omedelbar tillg\\u00e5ng till en samling av EA:s mest uppskattade spel.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Prova n\\u00e5got nytt[\\\/b]\\nTesta utvalda spelsl\\u00e4pp fr\\u00e5n EA i upp till 10 timmar.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]F\\u00e5 mer f\\u00f6r mindre[\\\/b]\\nF\\u00e5 10 % rabatt p\\u00e5 digitala k\\u00f6p fr\\u00e5n EA p\\u00e5 allt fr\\u00e5n hela spel till DLC.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Jutalmazd elk\\u00f6telezetts\\u00e9ged[\\\/b]\\nOldj fel jutalmakat \\u00e9s csak el\\u0151fizet\\u0151knek el\\u00e9rhet\\u0151 tartalmakat.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Mindig van mivel j\\u00e1tszani[\\\/b]\\nSzerezz azonnali hozz\\u00e1f\\u00e9r\\u00e9st az EA legkedveltebb j\\u00e1t\\u00e9kaihoz.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Pr\\u00f3b\\u00e1lj ki valami \\u00fajat[\\\/b]\\nJ\\u00e1tssz ak\\u00e1r 10 \\u00f3r\\u00e1n kereszt\\u00fcl, v\\u00e1logatott, \\u00faj megjelen\\u00e9s\\u0171 EA j\\u00e1t\\u00e9kokkal.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]T\\u00f6bbet, kevesebb\\u00e9rt[\\\/b]\\nSp\\u00f3rolj meg 10%-ot az EA digit\\u00e1lis v\\u00e1s\\u00e1rl\\u00e1sokon, teljes j\\u00e1t\\u00e9kokt\\u00f3l a DLC-kig.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]U\\u017e\\u00edvejte si odm\\u011bny[\\\/b]\\nOdemykejte exkluzivn\\u00ed odm\\u011bny a obsah pouze pro p\\u0159edplatitele.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]M\\u011bjte st\\u00e1le co hr\\u00e1t[\\\/b]\\nVyu\\u017e\\u00edvejte okam\\u017eit\\u00e9ho p\\u0159\\u00edstupu ke kolekci nejobl\\u00edben\\u011bj\\u0161\\u00edch her od EA.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Zkou\\u0161ejte novinky[\\\/b]\\nHrajte vybran\\u00e9 novinky od EA a\\u017e po dobu 10 hodin.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Z\\u00edsk\\u00e1vejte v\\u00edce za m\\u00e9n\\u011b[\\\/b]\\nU\\u0161et\\u0159ete 10 % na digit\\u00e1ln\\u00edch n\\u00e1kupech od EA, od pln\\u00fdch her po DLC.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]R\\u0103spl\\u0103te\\u0219te-\\u021bi pasiunea[\\\/b]\\nDeblocheaz\\u0103 recompense exclusive \\u0219i con\\u021binut disponibil numai pentru abona\\u021bi.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]\\u00centotdeauna exist\\u0103 un nou titlu de jucat[\\\/b]\\nOb\\u021bine acces instant la o colec\\u021bie de jocuri EA favorite.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]\\u00cencearc\\u0103 ceva nou[\\\/b]\\nJoac\\u0103 timp de p\\u00e2n\\u0103 la 10 ore o selec\\u021bie de titluri EA lansate recent.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Ob\\u021bine mai mult, pl\\u0103te\\u0219te mai pu\\u021bin[\\\/b]\\nEconomise\\u0219te 10% la achizi\\u021biile digitale EA, at\\u00e2t pentru jocuri complete, c\\u00e2t \\u0219i pentru DLC-uri.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table  noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Play List[\\\/b]\\nEA'in favori serilerinden ve en pop\\u00fcler oyunlar\\u0131ndan olu\\u015fan e\\u015fsiz bir koleksiyona s\\u0131n\\u0131rs\\u0131z eri\\u015fim.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Oyun Denemeleri[\\\/b]\\nSe\\u00e7ili yeni oyunlar\\u0131 10 saate kadar deneyin ve yeni favorilerinizi ke\\u015ffedin.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]\\u00dcye \\u00d6d\\u00fclleri[\\\/b]\\nHer ay en pop\\u00fcler EA oyunlar\\u0131ndaki \\u00fcye \\u00f6d\\u00fcllerini a\\u00e7\\u0131n.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]%10 \\u0130ndirim[\\\/b]\\nDijital EA sat\\u0131n al\\u0131mlar\\u0131nda %10 indirimden yararlan\\u0131n (oyun indirmeleri, puan paketleri ve DLC'ler dahil).[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Recompense a sua dedica\\u00e7\\u00e3o[\\\/b]\\nDestrave recompensas exclusivas e conte\\u00fado somente para membros.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Sempre h\\u00e1 algo mais para jogar[\\\/b]\\nObtenha acesso instant\\u00e2neo \\u00e0 cole\\u00e7\\u00e3o dos jogos favoritos da EA.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Explore algo novo[\\\/b]\\nJogue novos lan\\u00e7amentos selecionados pela EA por at\\u00e9 10 horas.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/15e6f11ab4d0e3735bc1160f81df40dd94a72a63.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]Obtenha mais, por menos[\\\/b]\\nEconomize 10% em compras digitais na EA, de jogos completos \\u00e0 conte\\u00fados adicionais.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[\\\/table]\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[table noborder=1]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/45c76ff2cc8b7a5b3dbf3a8dcdde32aabed86e73.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]\\u0412\\u044a\\u0437\\u043d\\u0430\\u0433\\u0440\\u0430\\u0434\\u0435\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0412\\u0430\\u0448\\u0430\\u0442\\u0430 \\u0432\\u0441\\u0435\\u043e\\u0442\\u0434\\u0430\\u0439\\u043d\\u043e\\u0441\\u0442[\\\/b]\\n\\u041e\\u0442\\u043a\\u043b\\u044e\\u0447\\u0435\\u0442\\u0435 \\u0435\\u043a\\u0441\\u043a\\u043b\\u0443\\u0437\\u0438\\u0432\\u043d\\u0438 \\u043d\\u0430\\u0433\\u0440\\u0430\\u0434\\u0438 \\u0438 \\u0441\\u044a\\u0434\\u044a\\u0440\\u0436\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u0435 \\u0441\\u0430\\u043c\\u043e \\u0437\\u0430 \\u0447\\u043b\\u0435\\u043d\\u043e\\u0432\\u0435.[\\\/td]\\n[td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/9ed3bd8017f314912ad77a348499d7209a64b2db.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]\\u0412\\u0438\\u043d\\u0430\\u0433\\u0438 \\u0438\\u043c\\u0430 \\u043e\\u0449\\u0435 \\u0437\\u0430 \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0430[\\\/b]\\n\\u041f\\u043e\\u043b\\u0443\\u0447\\u0435\\u0442\\u0435 \\u043d\\u0435\\u0437\\u0430\\u0431\\u0430\\u0432\\u0435\\u043d \\u0434\\u043e\\u0441\\u0442\\u044a\\u043f \\u0434\\u043e \\u043a\\u043e\\u043b\\u0435\\u043a\\u0446\\u0438\\u044f \\u043e\\u0442 \\u043d\\u0430\\u0439-\\u043e\\u0431\\u0438\\u0447\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u0442\\u0435 EA \\u0438\\u0433\\u0440\\u0438.[\\\/td]\\n[\\\/tr]\\n[tr]\\n[td]\\n[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\\\/36135791\\\/f41383ddf9490f3b2ac06537025f3c16b0fee1f6.png[\\\/img]\\n[\\\/td][td]    [\\\/td]\\n[td][b]\\u041e\\u043f\\u0438\\u0442\\u0430\\u0439\