u0427\\u0430\\u0441\\u0442\\u044b\\u0435 \\u0432\\u043e\\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0441\\u044b\&quot;,\&quot;\\u0e04\\u0e33\\u0e16\\u0e32\\u0e21\\u0e17\\u0e35\\u0e48\\u0e1e\\u0e1a\\u0e1a\\u0e48\\u0e2d\\u0e22\&quot;,\&quot;\\u3088\\u304f\\u3042\\u308b\\u8cea\\u554f\&quot;,\&quot;Perguntas mais frequentes\&quot;,\&quot;Najcz\\u0119\\u015bciej zadawane pytania\&quot;,\&quot;Ofte stillede sp\\u00f8rgsm\\u00e5l\&quot;,\&quot;Veelgestelde vragen\&quot;,\&quot;Usein kysytyt kysymykset\&quot;,\&quot;Vanlige sp\\u00f8rsm\\u00e5l\&quot;,\&quot;Vanliga fr\\u00e5gor\&quot;,\&quot;Gyakran ism\\u00e9telt k\\u00e9rd\\u00e9sek\&quot;,\&quot;\\u010cast\\u00e9 dotazy\&quot;,\&quot;\\u00centreb\\u0103ri frecvente\&quot;,\&quot;S\\u0131k\\u00e7a Sorulan Sorular\&quot;,\&quot;Perguntas Frequentes\&quot;,\&quot;\\u0427\\u0435\\u0441\\u0442\\u043e \\u0437\\u0430\\u0434\\u0430\\u0432\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438 \\u0432\\u044a\\u043f\\u0440\\u043e\\u0441\\u0438\&quot;,\&quot;\\u03a3\\u03c5\\u03c7\\u03bd\\u03ad\\u03c2 \\u03b5\\u03c1\\u03c9\\u03c4\\u03ae\\u03c3\\u03b5\\u03b9\\u03c2\&quot;,null,\&quot;\\u0427\\u0430\\u0441\\u0442\\u0456 \\u043f\\u0438\\u0442\\u0430\\u043d\\u043d\\u044f\&quot;,\&quot;Preguntas frecuentes\&quot;,\&quot;H\\u1ecfi \\u0111\\u00e1p th\\u01b0\\u1eddng g\\u1eb7p\&quot;,null,null],\&quot;localized_label_image\&quot;:[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\&quot;default_label\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;section_type\&quot;:\&quot;text_section\&quot;,\&quot;unique_id\&quot;:58057,\&quot;internal_section_data\&quot;:null,\&quot;text_section_contents\&quot;:[\&quot;[h1]What is EA Play?[\\\/h1]\\nEA Play is the ultimate game membership for fans of EA games. With EA Play, you\\u2019ll get unlimited access to a collection of beloved Electronic Arts titles, trials of select new-releases, monthly member rewards, and more\\u2014all for just $5.99 a month or $39.99 a year.\\nHere is what\\u2019s included:\\n[list]\\n[*] Unlimited access to an unrivaled collection of EA\\u2019s fan-favorite franchises and top titles.\\n[*] Try select new-release titles for up to 10 hours with no commitments.\\n[*] New rewards every month in the hottest EA titles including cosmetic items, points packs, and more.\\n[*] A 10% discount on purchases of EA digital content, including full games, points packs, and DLC.\\n[\\\/list]\\n\\n[h1]How do I join EA Play?[\\\/h1]\\nSimple - all you gotta do is sign up. Just follow the on-screen instructions and you'll be diving into games in no time.\\n\\n[h1]What games do I get with EA Play on Steam?[\\\/h1]\\nMembers get unlimited access to The Play List, a collection of top EA titles including franchises like Battlefield\\u2122, EA SPORTS FC\\u2122, F1\\u00ae, Madden NFL, The Sims\\u2122, STAR WARS\\u2122, and many more. Check out the full list of games available on Steam. \\nThey can also play trials of select-new release EA games for up to 10 hours. Please note, title availability varies by platform.\\n\\n[h1]Where do I go to download games and trials?[\\\/h1]\\nTo download a game or trial with EA Play on Steam, search for the game in your Steam library, and download it directly from there. Make sure your Steam and EA accounts are linked if prompted.\\n\\n[h1]What's The Play List?[\\\/h1]\\nThe Play List is our collection of incredible games, featuring new hits, fan-favorites, and so much more\\u2014 all included in your membership. All full versions for you to play as much as you want, with more titles added continually. See all games on The Play List here.\\n\\n[h1]Why do games on The Play List vary from country to country?[\\\/h1]\\nShort answer: different countries have different rules about what games can be sold or made available. As a result, the games you see in The Play List may vary slightly by location.\\n\\n[h1]Do I get to keep playing the games after the trial period?[\\\/h1]\\nOnce your trial is complete, you\\u2019ll need to purchase the game if you\\u2019d like to continue playing.\\n \\n[h1]If I play an EA Play game trial will my progress carry over?[\\\/h1]\\nYes, after your limited trial of the latest EA games ends, your progress will carry over. Then, you can continue where you left off if you decide to purchase the game.\\n\\n[h1]What can I use my 10% member discount on?[\\\/h1]\\nAs an EA Play member, you'll automatically score a 10% discount on EA digital purchases from the platform you have EA Play access to, including new releases, pre-orders, expansions, game packs, points\\u2014you name it. Please note: while EA Play is available on multiple platforms, your discount applies only to the platform you joined on. For example, if you joined on the Epic Games Store, your EA digital purchases would receive a 10% discount there. Similarly, if you joined on Xbox, your EA digital purchases on Xbox would receive the discount.\\n\\n[h1]What platforms is EA Play available on?[\\\/h1]\\nEA Play is available on Xbox, PlayStation\\u00ae, PC via the Epic Games Store, the EA app, and Steam, and Mac through the EA app. Please note, while EA Play is available on multiple platforms, your membership is tied to the platform you joined on. For example, if you joined on PlayStation\\u00ae, your Play List, member discount, and all other benefits will only be available there. \\n \\n[h1]Can I play EA Play games on Mac?[\\\/h1]\\nYou sure can. EA Play is now available on Mac through the EA app.\\n\\n[h1]What payment methods can I use to purchase an EA Play membership?[\\\/h1]\\nDepending on your location, you can use a credit card, PayPal, or your Steam Wallet. Please note that not all payment methods are available in every region.\\n  \\n[h1]How much is EA Play?[\\\/h1]\\nAn EA Play membership costs just $5.99 a month, or you can save even more by signing up for a full year at $39.99. And with your 10% discount, the membership practically pays for itself if you buy even one game!\\n\\n[h1]How do I cancel my EA Play membership? What happens if I cancel?[\\\/h1]\\nIf you cancel your membership before your next monthly or annual billing date, you won\\u2019t be charged for the following month or year. You\\u2019ll still have access to play games, use your discount, and try available trials until your membership expires.\\n\\nCanceling your EA Play membership is simple and hassle-free. Just log into your Steam account and select Recurring Subscriptions. Click the \\u201cCancel my subscription\\u201d option and the \\u201cApply\\u201d button.\\n\\nIf you cancel, you'll lose all EA Play benefits at the end of your current billing cycle, including access to trials and games in our collection. If you decide to join again, your save files will remain, so you can pick up where you left off.\\n\\nConditions, limitations and exclusions apply. See [url=https:\\\/\\\/tos.ea.com\\\/legalapp\\\/eaplay\\\/US\\\/en\\\/PC\\\/]EA Play Terms [\\\/url]for details.\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[h1][b]Was ist EA Play*?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEA Play ist die ultimative Videospiel-Mitgliedschaft f\\u00fcr alle Fans der EA-Spiele. Mit EA Play erh\\u00e4ltst du unbegrenzten Zugriff auf eine Sammlung beliebter Titel von Electronic Arts, Trials ausgew\\u00e4hlter Neuerscheinungen, monatliche Mitgliederbelohnungen und mehr\\u00a0\\u2013 all das f\\u00fcr nur 5,99\\u00a0\\u20ac pro Monat oder 39,99\\u00a0\\u20ac pro Jahr.\\n\\n[u]Das alles ist enthalten:[\\\/u]\\n[list]\\n[*] Unbegrenzter Zugriff auf eine einzigartige Sammlung unserer beliebtesten Franchises und Top-Titel.\\n[*] Die M\\u00f6glichkeit, ausgew\\u00e4hlte, neu ver\\u00f6ffentlichte Titel bis zu 10 Stunden lang ohne jegliche Verpflichtungen zu testen.\\n[*] Monatlich neue Belohnungen f\\u00fcr die beliebtesten EA-Titel in Form von kosmetischen Gegenst\\u00e4nden, Point-Packs und mehr.\\n[*] Ein Rabatt in H\\u00f6he von 10\\u00a0% beim Kauf von digitalen EA-Inhalten, einschlie\\u00dflich bei vollst\\u00e4ndigen Spielen, Point-Packs und DLCs.\\n[\\\/list]\\n\\n[h1][b]Wie werde ich Mitglied bei EA Play?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nGanz einfach: Du musst dich nur registrieren. Folge einfach den Anweisungen auf dem Bildschirm und schon wirst du in k\\u00fcrzester Zeit in Spielen eintauchen k\\u00f6nnen. Du kannst auch direkt \\u00fcber den Store auf deiner bevorzugten Plattform beitreten.\\u00a0\\n\\n[h1][b]Welche Spiele erhalte ich mit EA Play?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nMitglieder erhalten unbegrenzten Zugriff auf The Play List\\u00a0\\u2013 eine Sammlung aus Top-EA-Titeln aus Franchises wie Battlefield\\u2122, EA SPORTS FC\\u2122, F1\\u00ae, Madden NFL, Die Sims\\u2122, STAR WARS\\u2122 und vielen mehr. Sie k\\u00f6nnen zudem bis zu 10 Stunden lang Trials von ausgew\\u00e4hlten, neu ver\\u00f6ffentlichten EA-Titeln spielen. Die Verf\\u00fcgbarkeit der Spieltitel variiert je nach Plattform.\\n\\n[h1][b]Was ist The Play List?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nThe Play List ist unsere Sammlung unglaublicher Spiele\\u00a0\\u2013 bestehend aus neuen Hits, beliebten Klassikern und vielem mehr\\u00a0\\u2013 die in deiner Mitgliedschaft enthalten ist. Du kannst alle Vollversionen unbegrenzt spielen und es werden stetig neue Titel hinzugef\\u00fcgt. Hier findest du alle Spiele in The Play List.\\n\\n[h1][b]Warum unterscheiden sich die in The Play List verf\\u00fcgbaren Spiele von Land zu Land?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nKurz gesagt: Unterschiedliche L\\u00e4nder haben unterschiedliche Regeln, wenn es darum geht, welche Spiele verkauft oder zur Verf\\u00fcgung gestellt werden k\\u00f6nnen. Daher kann sich das Angebot in The Play List je nach Region leicht unterscheiden.\\n\\n[h1][b]Kann ich die Spiele auch nach der Testphase spielen?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nSobald du eine Trial abgeschlossen hast, musst du das Spiel kaufen, wenn du es weiterspielen willst.\\n\\n[h1][b]Wird mein Spielfortschritt \\u00fcbernommen, wenn ich \\u00fcber EA Play eine Trial spiele?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nJa, nach Ende der begrenzten Trial der neuesten EA-Spiele wird dein Fortschritt \\u00fcbernommen. Wenn du dich entscheidest, das Spiel zu kaufen, kannst du dort weiterspielen, wo du aufgeh\\u00f6rt hast.\\n\\n[h1][b]Wof\\u00fcr kann ich meinen Mitgliedsrabatt nutzen?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nAls EA Play-Mitglieder erh\\u00e4ltst du automatisch 10\\u00a0% Rabatt auf digitale EA-Eink\\u00e4ufe \\u00fcber die Plattform, auf der du EA Play nutzt, einschlie\\u00dflich auf Neuerscheinungen, Vorbestellungen, Erweiterungen, Gameplay-Packs, Points und mehr. Bitte beachte: EA Play ist zwar auf mehreren Plattformen verf\\u00fcgbar, doch der Rabatt gilt nur f\\u00fcr die Plattform, auf der du beigetreten bist. Wenn du zum Beispiel \\u00fcber den Epic Games Store beigetreten bist, erh\\u00e4ltst du hier einen Rabatt von 10\\u00a0% auf deine digitalen EA-Eink\\u00e4ufe. Wenn du auf Xbox beigetreten bist, erh\\u00e4ltst du auf Xbox 10\\u00a0% Rabatt auf deine digitalen EA-K\\u00e4ufe.\\n\\n[h1][b]Auf welchen Plattformen ist EA Play verf\\u00fcgbar?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEA Play ist auf Xbox, PlayStation\\u00ae, PC \\u00fcber den Epic Games Store, EA app und Steam und Mac \\u00fcber EA app verf\\u00fcgbar. Bitte beachte: Obwohl EA Play auf mehreren Plattformen verf\\u00fcgbar ist, ist deine Mitgliedschaft an die Plattform gebunden, auf der du beigetreten bist. Wenn du zum Beispiel auf PlayStation\\u00ae beigetreten bist, sind deine Play List, Mitgliedsrabatte und alle anderen Vorteile nur dort verf\\u00fcgbar.\\u00a0\\n\\n[h1][b]Kann ich EA Play-Spiele auf Mac spielen?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nNat\\u00fcrlich! EA Play ist nun \\u00fcber EA app f\\u00fcr Mac verf\\u00fcgbar.\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u00dcber welche Zahlungsarten kann ich eine EA Play-Mitgliedschaft kaufen?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nJe nach Standort kannst du deine Kreditkarte, PayPal oder das Guthaben der jeweiligen Plattform nutzen (manche Plattformen bieten zus\\u00e4tzliche Zahlungsarten). Bitte beachte, dass nicht alle Zahlungsarten in jeder Region verf\\u00fcgbar sind.\\n\\n[h1][b]Wie viel kostet EA Play?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEine EA Play-Mitgliedschaft kostet nur 5,99\\u00a0\\u20ac pro Monat. Du kannst sogar noch mehr sparen, wenn du eine Jahresmitgliedschaft f\\u00fcr nur 39,99\\u00a0\\u20ac pro Monat abschlie\\u00dft. Und mit deinem 10\\u00a0% Rabatt hast du den Preis deiner EA-Play-Mitgliedschaft mit nur einem Spielkauf bereits wieder reingeholt!\\n\\n[h1][b]Was ist, wenn ich EA Play vor dem Ende meiner Mitgliedschaft k\\u00fcndigen m\\u00f6chte?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nWenn du deine Mitgliedschaft vor dem n\\u00e4chsten monatlichen oder j\\u00e4hrlichen Abrechnungszeitpunkt k\\u00fcndigst, wird dir der folgende Monat bzw. das folgende Jahr nicht berechnet. Du hast weiterhin Zugriff auf deine Spiele, kannst deinen Rabatt nutzen und Trials austesten, bis deine Mitgliedschaft abgelaufen ist.\\n\\n[h1][b]Wie k\\u00fcndige ich meine EA Play-Mitgliedschaft?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nDu kannst deine EA Play-Mitgliedschaft ganz einfach und ohne Schwierigkeiten k\\u00fcndigen. W\\u00e4hle das Register auf der Plattform, \\u00fcber der du EA Play beigetreten bist, und befolge die Anweisungen.\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[h1][b]Qu'est-ce qu'EA Play*\\u00a0?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEA Play est l'abonnement id\\u00e9al pour toutes les personnes qui aiment les jeux EA. EA Play vous offre un acc\\u00e8s illimit\\u00e9 aux titres les plus populaires d'Electronic Arts, \\u00e0 des essais de nouveaux jeux EA, \\u00e0 des r\\u00e9compenses mensuelles r\\u00e9serv\\u00e9es aux membres et plus encore, pour seulement 5,99\\u00a0\\u20ac par mois ou 39,99\\u00a0\\u20ac par an\\u00a0!\\n\\n[u]Voici ce qui est inclus\\u00a0:[\\\/u]\\n[list]\\n[*] Profitez d'un acc\\u00e8s illimit\\u00e9 \\u00e0 une collection incomparable de hits et de franchises populaires.\\n[*] Essayez une s\\u00e9lection de nouveaux titres pendant 10\\u00a0heures sans engagement.\\n[*] Chaque mois, vous obtenez des \\u00e9l\\u00e9ments cosm\\u00e9tiques, des packs de points et bien d'autres r\\u00e9compenses pour les titres EA les plus populaires.\\n[*] Une remise de 10\\u00a0% sur vos achats de contenu num\\u00e9rique EA, en particulier les jeux complets, les packs de points et plus encore.\\n[\\\/list]\\n\\n[h1][b]Comment rejoindre EA Play\\u00a0?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nC'est tr\\u00e8s simple\\u00a0: il vous suffit de vous abonner. Suivez les instructions \\u00e0 l'\\u00e9cran et vous croulerez sous les jeux en un rien de temps. Vous pouvez \\u00e9galement vous abonner directement dans la boutique de la plateforme de votre choix.\\u00a0\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u00c0 quels jeux puis-je jouer avec EA Play\\u00a0?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nSi vous \\u00eates membre, vous b\\u00e9n\\u00e9ficiez d'un acc\\u00e8s illimit\\u00e9 \\u00e0 The Play List, une collection des meilleurs jeux d'EA comme Battlefield\\u2122, EA SPORTS FC\\u2122, F1\\u00ae, Madden NFL, Les Sims\\u2122, STAR WARS\\u2122 et bien d'autres encore. Vous pouvez \\u00e9galement jouer \\u00e0 une s\\u00e9lection de nouveaux jeux EA pendant 10\\u00a0heures. Notez que la disponibilit\\u00e9 des titres varie en fonction de la plateforme.\\n\\n[h1][b]Qu\\u2019est-ce que The Play List\\u00a0?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nVotre abonnement vous donne acc\\u00e8s \\u00e0 The Play List, une collection de jeux exceptionnels regroupant des jeux \\u00e0 succ\\u00e8s, des titres populaires et bien plus encore. Les versions compl\\u00e8tes sont disponibles \\u00e0 volont\\u00e9 et de nouveaux titres sont ajout\\u00e9s r\\u00e9guli\\u00e8rement. D\\u00e9couvrez tous les jeux de The Play List ici.\\n\\n[h1][b]Pourquoi les jeux de The Play List varient-ils d\\u2019un pays \\u00e0 l\\u2019autre\\u00a0?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nPour faire court, chaque pays a ses propres r\\u00e8gles relatives aux jeux pouvant \\u00eatre vendus ou rendus disponibles. En cons\\u00e9quence, les jeux disponibles dans The Play List peuvent varier l\\u00e9g\\u00e8rement selon votre territoire.\\n\\n[h1][b]Puis-je continuer \\u00e0 jouer aux jeux apr\\u00e8s la p\\u00e9riode d'essai\\u00a0?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nUne fois votre essai termin\\u00e9, vous devez acheter le jeu si vous souhaitez continuer \\u00e0 jouer.\\n\\n[h1][b]Si je joue \\u00e0 la version d\\u2019essai d\\u2019un jeu sur EA Play, ma progression sera-t-elle conserv\\u00e9e\\u00a0?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nOui, apr\\u00e8s la fin de votre essai limit\\u00e9 des derniers jeux EA, votre progression sera conserv\\u00e9e. Vous pourrez ensuite reprendre l\\u00e0 o\\u00f9 vous en \\u00e9tiez si vous d\\u00e9cidez d\\u2019acheter le jeu.\\n\\n[h1][b]Sur quoi ma remise de membre est-elle applicable\\u00a0?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEn tant que membre d'EA Play, vous b\\u00e9n\\u00e9ficiez automatiquement d'une remise de 10\\u00a0% sur les achats d\\u00e9mat\\u00e9rialis\\u00e9s EA effectu\\u00e9s sur votre plateforme d'acc\\u00e8s \\u00e0 EA Play, en particulier les nouveaut\\u00e9s, les pr\\u00e9commandes, les extensions, les packs de jeu, les points, etc. Remarque\\u00a0: bien qu'EA Play soit disponible sur plusieurs plateformes, votre remise s'applique uniquement \\u00e0 la plateforme sur laquelle vous avez souscrit votre abonnement. Par exemple, si vous vous abonnez sur Epic Games Store, vous b\\u00e9n\\u00e9ficierez d'une remise de 10\\u00a0% sur les achats d\\u00e9mat\\u00e9rialis\\u00e9s EA effectu\\u00e9s sur cette plateforme. De m\\u00eame, si vous vous abonnez sur Xbox, vous b\\u00e9n\\u00e9ficierez de la remise sur achats d\\u00e9mat\\u00e9rialis\\u00e9s EA effectu\\u00e9s sur Xbox.\\n\\n[h1][b]Sur quelles plateformes EA Play est-il disponible\\u00a0?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEA Play est disponible sur Xbox, PlayStation\\u00ae, PC via Epic Games Store, EA app et Steam, et Mac via EA app. Remarque\\u00a0: EA Play est disponible sur plusieurs plateformes, mais votre abonnement est li\\u00e9 \\u00e0 la plateforme sur laquelle vous l'avez souscrit. Par exemple, si vous souscrivez un abonnement sur PlayStation\\u00ae, The Play List, votre remise de membre et tous les autres avantages ne seront disponibles que sur cette plateforme.\\u00a0\\n\\n[h1][b]Puis-je jouer aux jeux EA Play sur Mac\\u00a0?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nOui, c'est possible. EA Play est d\\u00e9sormais disponible sur Mac via EA app.\\n\\n[h1][b]Quels moyens de paiement puis-je utiliser pour r\\u00e9gler un abonnement EA Play\\u00a0?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEn fonction de votre pays, vous pouvez utiliser une carte bancaire, un compte PayPal ou un portefeuille de plateforme (pour d'autres moyens de paiement, consultez les onglets de votre plateforme). Notez que certains moyens de paiement ne sont pas disponibles dans certaines r\\u00e9gions.\\n\\n[h1][b]Combien co\\u00fbte EA Play\\u00a0?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nL'abonnement \\u00e0 EA Play ne co\\u00fbte que 5,99\\u00a0\\u20ac par mois. \\u00c9conomisez encore plus en vous abonnant pour une ann\\u00e9e pour 39,99\\u00a0\\u20ac. Gr\\u00e2ce \\u00e0 votre remise de 10\\u00a0%, votre abonnement est quasiment rembours\\u00e9 d\\u00e8s le premier jeu achet\\u00e9\\u00a0!\\n\\n[h1][b]Comment r\\u00e9silier mon abonnement EA Play avant la fin de sa p\\u00e9riode de validit\\u00e9\\u00a0?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nSi vous annulez votre abonnement avant votre prochaine date de facturation mensuelle ou annuelle, la facturation du mois suivant ou de l'ann\\u00e9e suivante ne vous sera pas effectu\\u00e9e. Vous pourrez toujours acc\\u00e9der aux jeux, utiliser votre remise et profiter des essais disponibles jusqu'\\u00e0 l'expiration de votre abonnement.\\n\\n[h1][b]Comment r\\u00e9silier mon abonnement EA Play\\u00a0?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nLa r\\u00e9siliation de votre abonnement EA Play est simple et rapide. S\\u00e9lectionnez l'onglet de la plateforme sur laquelle vous avez souscrit l'abonnement EA Play et suivez les instructions.\\n\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[h1][b]Cos'\\u00e8 EA Play*?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEA Play \\u00e8 il miglior abbonamento videoludico per fan dei giochi EA. Con EA Play puoi accedere in modo illimitato a una collezione dei titoli pi\\u00f9 amati di Electronic Arts, versioni di prova di nuovi giochi EA selezionati, ricompense mensili per i membri e molto altro, il tutto a soli 5,99 \\u20ac al mese o 39,99 \\u20ac all'anno.\\n\\n[u]Ecco che cosa include:[\\\/u]\\n[list]\\n[*] Accesso illimitato a una raccolta dei franchise pi\\u00f9 amati e dei titoli migliori.\\n[*] Puoi provare nuovi giochi selezionati per un massimo di 10 ore senza obbligo di acquisto.\\n[*] Ogni mese nuove ricompense nei migliori titoli EA, tra cui oggetti cosmetici, pacchetti di punti e molto altro.\\n[*] Uno sconto del 10% sull'acquisto di contenuti digitali EA, inclusi giochi completi, pacchetti di punti e DLC.\\n[\\\/list]\\n\\n[h1][b]Come faccio a unirmi a EA Play?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nSemplice: basta registrarsi. Segui le istruzioni sullo schermo e ti troverai a sguazzare in un mare di giochi in men che non si dica. Puoi anche iscriverti direttamente dal negozio della tua piattaforma preferita.\\u00a0\\n\\n[h1][b]Quali giochi ottengo con EA Play?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nI membri ottengono accesso illimitato a The Play List, una collezione dei migliori titoli EA, tra cui franchise come Battlefield\\u2122, EA SPORTS FC\\u2122, F1\\u00ae, Madden NFL, The Sims\\u2122, STAR WARS\\u2122 e molti altri. Possono anche giocare a nuove uscite selezionate di giochi EA per un massimo di 10 ore. Nota: la disponibilit\\u00e0 del titolo varia in base alla piattaforma.\\n\\n[h1][b]Che cos'\\u00e8 The Play List?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nThe Play List \\u00e8 una collezione di giochi incredibili che include nuovi successi, i titoli pi\\u00f9 amati dai fan e molto altro inclusi nel tuo abbonamento. Tutte le versioni complete a cui potrai giocare quanto vuoi, con titoli aggiunti continuamente. Scopri tutti i giochi in The Play List qui.\\n[h1][b]\\nPerch\\u00e9 i giochi in The Play List variano da Paese a Paese?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nRisposta breve: ogni Paese ha regole diverse su quali giochi possano essere venduti o resi disponibili. Di conseguenza, i giochi visualizzati in The Play List potrebbero variare leggermente in base alla localit\\u00e0.\\n\\n[h1][b]Posso continuare a giocare ai giochi anche dopo il periodo di prova?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nUna volta completata la versione di prova, dovrai acquistare il gioco se vuoi continuare a giocare.\\n\\n[h1][b]Se gioco a una versione di prova con EA Play i miei progressi verranno mantenuti?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nS\\u00ec, una volta terminata la versione di prova limitata dei giochi EA pi\\u00f9 recenti, i tuoi progressi verranno mantenuti. Successivamente, se deciderai di acquistare il gioco, potrai continuare da dove avevi interrotto.\\n\\n[h1][b]Per cosa posso usare il mio sconto per gli abbonati?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nIn qualit\\u00e0 di membro di EA Play, otterrai automaticamente uno sconto del 10% sugli acquisti digitali EA dalla piattaforma a cui hai accesso a EA Play, incluse nuove uscite, prenotazioni, espansioni, Game Pack e punti. Nota: sebbene EA Play sia disponibile su pi\\u00f9 piattaforme, lo sconto si applica solo alla piattaforma tramite la quale hai effettuato l'iscrizione. Per esempio, se hai effettuato l'iscrizione tramite Epic Games Store, i tuoi acquisti digitali EA riceveranno uno sconto del 10% solo in questa piattaforma. Se hai effettuato l'iscrizione tramite Xbox, i tuoi acquisti digitali EA su Xbox saranno scontati.\\n\\n[h1][b]Su quali piattaforme \\u00e8 disponibile EA Play?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEA Play \\u00e8 disponibile su Xbox, PlayStation\\u00ae, PC tramite Epic Games Store, EA app e Steam e su Mac tramite EA app. Nota: sebbene EA Play sia disponibile su pi\\u00f9 piattaforme, il tuo abbonamento \\u00e8 legato alla piattaforma che hai usato per iscriverti. Se hai effettuato l'iscrizione tramite Steam, la tua lista di giochi, gli sconti per i membri e tutti gli altri vantaggi saranno disponibili solo l\\u00ec.\\u00a0\\n\\n[h1][b]Posso giocare ai giochi EA Play su Mac?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nMa certo. EA Play \\u00e8 ora disponibile per Mac grazie all'EA app.\\n\\n[h1][b]Quali metodi di pagamento posso usare per acquistare un abbonamento a EA Play?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nA seconda della tua posizione, puoi usare carta di credito, PayPal o il portafoglio della piattaforma (consulta le schede della piattaforma per altri metodi di pagamento). Ricorda che non tutti i metodi di pagamento sono disponibili in ogni regione.\\n\\n[h1][b]Quanto costa EA Play?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nUn abbonamento EA Play costa solo 5,99 \\u20ac al mese, oppure puoi risparmiare ancora di pi\\u00f9 iscrivendoti per un intero anno a 39,99 \\u20ac. E con il tuo 10% di sconto, l'abbonamento praticamente si ripaga se acquisti anche solo un gioco!\\n\\n[h1][b]E se volessi annullare EA Play prima della fine del mio abbonamento?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nSe annulli l'abbonamento prima della data di fatturazione mensile o annuale successiva, non ti sar\\u00e0 addebitato il mese o l'anno seguente. Potrai ancora accedere ai giochi, usare il tuo sconto e provare le versioni di prova disponibili fino alla scadenza del tuo abbonamento.\\n\\n[h1][b]Come posso annullare il mio abbonamento a EA Play?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nAnnullare il tuo abbonamento EA Play \\u00e8 semplice e veloce. Seleziona la scheda della piattaforma con cui hai effettuato l'iscrizione a EA Play e segui le istruzioni.\\n\\n\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[h1][b]EA Play*\\ub780 \\ubb34\\uc5c7\\uc785\\ub2c8\\uae4c?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEA Play\\ub294 EA \\uac8c\\uc784 \\ud32c\\ub4e4\\uc744 \\uc704\\ud55c \\ucd5c\\uace0\\uc758 \\uac8c\\uc784 \\uba64\\ubc84\\uc2ed\\uc785\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. EA Play\\ub97c \\uc774\\uc6a9\\ud558\\uba74 \\uc6d4 7,000\\uc6d0 \\ub610\\ub294 \\uc5f0\\uac04 47,000\\uc6d0\\uc5d0 \\uc778\\uae30 EA \\ud0c0\\uc774\\ud2c0 \\uceec\\ub809\\uc158, \\uc5c4\\uc120\\ub41c \\uc2e0\\uc791 \\ud2b8\\ub77c\\uc774\\uc5bc, \\uc6d4\\uac04 \\uba64\\ubc84 \\ubcf4\\uc0c1 \\ub4f1\\uc744 \\ubb34\\uc81c\\ud55c \\uc774\\uc6a9\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n\\n[u]\\ud3ec\\ud568\\ub418\\ub294 \\ud61c\\ud0dd\\uc740 \\ub2e4\\uc74c\\uacfc \\uac19\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4:[\\\/u]\\n[list]\\n[*] EA \\uc778\\uae30 \\ud504\\ub79c\\ucc28\\uc774\\uc988 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uacfc \\ub300\\uc791 \\ud0c0\\uc774\\ud2c0\\uc774 \\uac00\\ub4dd\\ud55c \\uceec\\ub809\\uc158\\uc744 \\ubb34\\uc81c\\ud55c\\uc73c\\ub85c \\uc774\\uc6a9\\ud558\\uc138\\uc694.\\n[*] \\ubcc4\\ub3c4\\uc758 \\uc57d\\uc815 \\uc5c6\\uc774 \\ucd5c\\ub300 10\\uc2dc\\uac04 \\ub3d9\\uc548 \\uc5c4\\uc120\\ub41c \\uc2e0\\uc791 \\ud0c0\\uc774\\ud2c0\\uc744 \\uccb4\\ud5d8\\ud558\\uc138\\uc694.\\n[*] \\uafb8\\ubbf8\\uae30 \\uc544\\uc774\\ud15c, \\ud3ec\\uc778\\ud2b8 \\ud329 \\ub4f1 \\uc778\\uae30 EA \\ud0c0\\uc774\\ud2c0\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\ub9e4\\ub2ec \\uc0c8\\ub85c\\uc6b4 \\ubcf4\\uc0c1\\uc744 \\ub4dc\\ub9bd\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n[*] \\uc815\\uc2dd \\uac8c\\uc784, \\ud3ec\\uc778\\ud2b8 \\ud329, DLC \\ub4f1 EA \\ub514\\uc9c0\\ud138 \\ucf58\\ud150\\uce20 \\uad6c\\ub9e4 \\uc2dc 10% \\ud560\\uc778 \\ud61c\\ud0dd\\uc774 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n[\\\/list]\\n\\n[h1][b]EA Play\\uc758 \\uba64\\ubc84\\uac00 \\ub418\\ub824\\uba74 \\uc5b4\\ub5bb\\uac8c \\ud558\\uba74 \\ub418\\ub098\\uc694?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\n\\uac00\\uc785\\ub9cc \\ud558\\uba74 \\ub429\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\ud654\\uba74\\uc5d0 \\ud45c\\uc2dc\\ub418\\ub294 \\uc548\\ub0b4\\ub97c \\ub530\\ub974\\uae30\\ub9cc \\ud558\\uba74 \\uace7\\ubc14\\ub85c \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc744 \\uc990\\uae38 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\ub610\\ud55c, \\uc120\\ud638\\ud558\\ub294 \\ud50c\\ub7ab\\ud3fc\\uc758 \\uc2a4\\ud1a0\\uc5b4\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\ubc14\\ub85c \\uac00\\uc785\\ud560 \\uc218\\ub3c4 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\u00a0\\n\\n[h1][b]EA Play\\ub85c \\uc5b4\\ub5a4 \\uac8c\\uc784\\ub4e4\\uc744 \\uc5bb\\uc744 \\uc218 \\uc788\\ub098\\uc694?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\n\\uba64\\ubc84\\ub294 Battlefield\\u2122, EA SPORTS FC\\u2122, F1\\u00ae, Madden NFL, The Sims\\u2122, STAR WARS\\u2122 \\ub4f1 \\uc778\\uae30 EA \\ud0c0\\uc774\\ud2c0\\uc774 \\uac00\\ub4dd\\ud55c \\uceec\\ub809\\uc158 The Play List\\ub97c \\ubb34\\uc81c\\ud55c\\uc73c\\ub85c \\uc774\\uc6a9\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\ub610\\ud55c \\uc5c4\\uc120\\ub41c \\uc2e0\\uc791 EA \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc758 \\ud2b8\\ub77c\\uc774\\uc5bc\\uc744 \\ucd5c\\ub300 10\\uc2dc\\uac04 \\ub3d9\\uc548 \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uc774\\uc6a9 \\uac00\\ub2a5\\ud55c \\ud0c0\\uc774\\ud2c0\\uc740 \\ud50c\\ub7ab\\ud3fc\\uc5d0 \\ub530\\ub77c \\ub2e4\\ub985\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n\\n[h1][b]The Play List\\uac00 \\ubb34\\uc5c7\\uc778\\uac00\\uc694?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nThe Play List\\ub294 \\uc2e0\\uaddc \\ud788\\ud2b8\\uc791, \\uc778\\uae30 \\uac8c\\uc784 \\ub4f1\\uc73c\\ub85c \\uad6c\\uc131\\ub41c \\ubc29\\ub300\\ud55c \\uac8c\\uc784 \\uceec\\ub809\\uc158\\uc73c\\ub85c EA Play \\uba64\\ubc84\\uc2ed\\uc5d0 \\ud3ec\\ud568\\ub418\\uc5b4 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\ubaa8\\ub4e0 \\uc815\\uc2dd \\ubc84\\uc804\\uc744 \\ub9c8\\uc74c\\uaecf \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc73c\\uba70, \\ub354 \\ub9ce\\uc740 \\ud0c0\\uc774\\ud2c0\\uc774 \\uc9c0\\uc18d\\uc801\\uc73c\\ub85c \\ucd94\\uac00\\ub429\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uc5ec\\uae30\\uc5d0\\uc11c The Play List\\uc758 \\uc804\\uccb4 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc744 \\ud655\\uc778\\ud558\\uc138\\uc694.\\n\\n[h1][b]The Play List\\uc758 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc774 \\uad6d\\uac00\\uc5d0 \\ub530\\ub77c \\ub2e4\\ub978 \\uc774\\uc720\\ub294 \\ubb34\\uc5c7\\uc785\\ub2c8\\uae4c?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\n\\uac04\\ub2e8\\ud788 \\ub9d0\\ud574 \\uad6d\\uac00\\ubcc4\\ub85c \\uac8c\\uc784 \\ud310\\ub9e4 \\ub610\\ub294 \\uc774\\uc6a9 \\uac00\\ub2a5 \\uaddc\\uc815\\uc774 \\ub2e4\\ub985\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uc774\\ub85c \\uc778\\ud574 The Play List\\uc758 \\uac8c\\uc784 \\ubaa9\\ub85d\\uc740 \\uc9c0\\uc5ed\\uc5d0 \\ub530\\ub77c \\uc870\\uae08 \\ub2e4\\ub97c \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n\\n[h1][b]\\ud2b8\\ub77c\\uc774\\uc5bc \\uae30\\uac04\\uc774 \\uc9c0\\ub09c \\ud6c4\\uc5d0\\ub3c4 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc744 \\uacc4\\uc18d \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\ub098\\uc694?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\n\\ud2b8\\ub77c\\uc774\\uc5bc\\uc774 \\uc644\\ub8cc\\ub418\\uba74 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc744 \\uad6c\\ub9e4\\ud574\\uc57c \\uacc4\\uc18d \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n\\n[h1][b]EA Play \\uac8c\\uc784 \\ud2b8\\ub77c\\uc774\\uc5bc\\uc744 \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774\\ud558\\uba74 \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc758 \\uc9c4\\ud589 \\uc0c1\\ud669\\uc740 \\uc800\\uc7a5\\ub418\\ub098\\uc694?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\n\\uc608, \\ucd5c\\uc2e0 EA \\uac8c\\uc784 \\ud2b8\\ub77c\\uc774\\uc5bc\\uc774 \\uc885\\ub8cc\\ub418\\ub41c \\ud6c4\\uc5d0\\ub3c4 \\uc9c4\\ud589 \\uc0c1\\ud669\\uc740 \\uacc4\\uc18d \\uc774\\uc5b4\\uc9d1\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uadf8\\ub7ec\\ubbc0\\ub85c \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc744 \\uad6c\\ub9e4\\ud558\\uba74 \\uc911\\ub2e8\\ud55c \\uacf3\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\ub2e4\\uc2dc \\uc9c4\\ud589\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n\\n[h1][b]\\uc5b4\\ub5a4 \\ud488\\ubaa9\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\uba64\\ubc84 \\ud560\\uc778\\uc744 \\ubc1b\\uc744 \\uc218 \\uc788\\ub098\\uc694?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEA Play \\uba64\\ubc84\\ub294 EA Play \\uc561\\uc138\\uc2a4 \\uad8c\\ud55c\\uc774 \\uc788\\ub294 \\ud50c\\ub7ab\\ud3fc\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\uc2e0\\uc791, \\uc608\\uc57d \\uad6c\\ub9e4, \\ud655\\uc7a5\\ud329, \\uac8c\\uc784 \\ud329, \\ud3ec\\uc778\\ud2b8 \\ub4f1 EA \\ub514\\uc9c0\\ud138 \\uad6c\\ub9e4 \\uc2dc 10% \\ud560\\uc778\\uc774 \\uc790\\ub3d9\\uc73c\\ub85c \\uc801\\uc6a9\\ub429\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\ucc38\\uace0\\ub85c EA Play\\ub294 \\uc5ec\\ub7ec \\ud50c\\ub7ab\\ud3fc\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\uc774\\uc6a9\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc9c0\\ub9cc, \\ud560\\uc778\\uc740 \\uba64\\ubc84\\uac00 \\uac00\\uc785\\ud55c \\ud50c\\ub7ab\\ud3fc\\uc5d0\\ub9cc \\uc801\\uc6a9\\ub429\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uc608\\ub97c \\ub4e4\\uc5b4, Epic Games Store\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\uac00\\uc785\\ud588\\ub2e4\\uba74 Epic Games Store\\uc5d0\\uc11c EA \\ub514\\uc9c0\\ud138 \\uad6c\\ub9e4 \\uc2dc 10% \\ud560\\uc778\\uc744 \\ubc1b\\uc744 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\ub9c8\\ucc2c\\uac00\\uc9c0\\ub85c Xbox\\ub97c \\ud1b5\\ud574 \\uac00\\uc785\\ud588\\ub2e4\\uba74, Xbox\\uc5d0\\uc11c\\uc758 EA \\ub514\\uc9c0\\ud138 \\uad6c\\ub9e4\\uc5d0 10% \\ud560\\uc778\\uc774 \\uc801\\uc6a9\\ub429\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n\\n[h1][b]EA Play\\ub294 \\uc5b4\\ub5a4 \\ud50c\\ub7ab\\ud3fc\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\uc774\\uc6a9\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\ub098\\uc694?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEA Play\\ub294 Xbox, PlayStation\\u00ae, PC\\uc5d0\\uc11c\\ub294 Epic Games Store, EA app, Steam, Mac\\uc5d0\\uc11c\\ub294 EA app\\uc744 \\ud1b5\\ud574 \\uc774\\uc6a9\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. EA Play\\ub294 \\uc5ec\\ub7ec \\ud50c\\ub7ab\\ud3fc\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\uc774\\uc6a9\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc9c0\\ub9cc, \\uba64\\ubc84\\uc2ed\\uc740 \\uac00\\uc785\\ud558\\uc2e0 \\ud50c\\ub7ab\\ud3fc\\uc5d0 \\uc5f0\\ub3d9\\ub429\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uc608\\ub97c \\ub4e4\\uc5b4, PlayStation\\u00ae\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\uac00\\uc785\\ud588\\ub2e4\\uba74 The Play List, \\uba64\\ubc84 \\ud560\\uc778, \\uae30\\ud0c0 \\ubaa8\\ub4e0 \\uba64\\ubc84 \\ud61c\\ud0dd\\uc740 \\ud574\\ub2f9 \\ud50c\\ub7ab\\ud3fc\\uc5d0\\uc11c\\ub9cc \\uc774\\uc6a9 \\uac00\\ub2a5\\ud569\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\u00a0\\n\\n[h1][b]EA Play \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc744 Mac\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\ub098\\uc694?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\n\\ubb3c\\ub860\\uc785\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. EA Play\\ub294 \\uc774\\uc81c Mac\\uc758 EA app\\uc744 \\ud1b5\\ud574 \\uc774\\uc6a9\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n\\n[h1][b]EA Play \\uba64\\ubc84\\uc2ed \\uad6c\\ub9e4\\uc5d0 \\uc0ac\\uc6a9\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\ub294 \\uacb0\\uc81c \\uc218\\ub2e8\\uc740 \\ubb34\\uc5c7\\uc778\\uac00\\uc694?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\n\\uc9c0\\uc5ed\\uc5d0 \\ub530\\ub77c \\uc2e0\\uc6a9\\uce74\\ub4dc, PayPal, \\ud50c\\ub7ab\\ud3fc \\uc9c0\\uac11 \\ub4f1\\uc744 \\uc0ac\\uc6a9\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4(\\ucd94\\uac00 \\uacb0\\uc81c \\ubc29\\ubc95\\uc740 \\ud50c\\ub7ab\\ud3fc \\ud0ed\\uc744 \\ucc38\\uc870\\ud558\\uc138\\uc694). \\ubaa8\\ub4e0 \\uc9c0\\uc5ed\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\ubaa8\\ub4e0 \\uacb0\\uc81c \\ubc29\\ubc95\\uc744 \\uc774\\uc6a9\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\ub294 \\uac83\\uc740 \\uc544\\ub2d9\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n\\n[h1][b]EA Play\\ub294 \\uc5bc\\ub9c8 \\uc778\\uac00\\uc694?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEA Play \\uba64\\ubc84\\uc2ed\\uc740 \\uc6d4 7,000\\uc6d0\\uc5d0 \\ubd88\\uacfc\\ud558\\uba70, \\uc5f0 47,000\\uc6d0\\uc73c\\ub85c \\uc5f0\\uac04\\uc73c\\ub85c \\uac00\\uc785\\ud558\\uba74 \\ub354\\uc6b1 \\uc800\\ub834\\ud558\\uac8c \\uc774\\uc6a9\\ud560 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uadf8\\ub9ac\\uace0 \\ub514\\uc9c0\\ud138 \\uad6c\\ub9e4 10% \\ud560\\uc778\\uc744 \\uc801\\uc6a9\\ubc1b\\uc73c\\ubbc0\\ub85c, \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc744 1\\uac1c\\ub77c\\ub3c4 \\uad6c\\ub9e4\\ud560 \\uacbd\\uc6b0 \\uba64\\ubc84\\uc2ed\\uc774 \\uc0ac\\uc2e4\\uc0c1 \\ubb34\\ub8cc\\uc785\\ub2c8\\ub2e4!\\n\\n[h1][b]\\uba64\\ubc84\\uc2ed \\uae30\\uac04\\uc774 \\ub05d\\ub098\\uae30 \\uc804\\uc5d0 EA Play\\ub97c \\ucde8\\uc18c\\ud558\\uace0 \\uc2f6\\ub2e4\\uba74 \\uc5b4\\ub5bb\\uac8c \\ud574\\uc57c \\ud558\\ub098\\uc694?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\n\\ub2e4\\uc74c \\uc6d4\\uac04 \\ub610\\ub294 \\uc5f0\\uac04 \\uccad\\uad6c\\uc77c \\uc804\\uc5d0 \\uba64\\ubc84\\uc2ed\\uc744 \\ucde8\\uc18c\\ud558\\uba74 \\ub2e4\\uc74c \\ub2ec \\ub610\\ub294 \\ub2e4\\uc74c \\ud574 \\uc5f0\\uac04 \\uc694\\uae08\\uc774 \\uccad\\uad6c\\ub418\\uc9c0 \\uc54a\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uba64\\ubc84\\uc2ed\\uc774 \\ub9cc\\ub8cc \\uc2dc\\uae4c\\uc9c0 \\uacc4\\uc18d\\ud574\\uc11c \\uac8c\\uc784\\uc744 \\ud50c\\ub808\\uc774\\ud558\\uace0, \\ud560\\uc778\\uc744 \\uc774\\uc6a9\\ud558\\uace0, \\ud2b8\\ub77c\\uc774\\uc5bc\\uc744 \\uc990\\uae38 \\uc218 \\uc788\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\\n\\n[h1][b]EA Play \\uba64\\ubc84\\uc2ed\\uc744 \\ucde8\\uc18c\\ud558\\ub824\\uba74 \\uc5b4\\ub5bb\\uac8c \\ud574\\uc57c \\ud558\\ub098\\uc694?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEA Play \\uba64\\ubc84\\uc2ed\\uc744 \\ucde8\\uc18c\\ud558\\ub294 \\ubc29\\ubc95\\uc740 \\uac04\\ub2e8\\ud569\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. EA Play\\uc5d0 \\uac00\\uc785\\ud55c \\ud50c\\ub7ab\\ud3fc\\uc5d0\\uc11c \\ud0ed\\uc744 \\uc120\\ud0dd\\ud558\\uace0 \\uc548\\ub0b4\\ub97c \\ub530\\ub974\\uc138\\uc694.\\n\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[h1][b]\\u00bfQu\\u00e9 es EA Play*?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEA Play es la mejor membres\\u00eda de juego para la afici\\u00f3n de los t\\u00edtulos de EA. Con EA Play tendr\\u00e1s acceso ilimitado a una colecci\\u00f3n de t\\u00edtulos aclamados de Electronic Arts, pruebas de una selecci\\u00f3n de lanzamientos nuevos, recompensas mensuales para miembros y mucho m\\u00e1s. \\u00a1Todo por solo 5,99\\u00a0\\u20ac al mes o 39,99\\u00a0\\u20ac al a\\u00f1o!\\n\\n[u]Esto es lo que incluye:[\\\/u]\\n[list]\\n[*] Acceso ilimitado a una colecci\\u00f3n inigualable de los mejores t\\u00edtulos y franquicias de EA favoritas de la comunidad.\\n[*] Prueba una selecci\\u00f3n de nuevos t\\u00edtulos durante un m\\u00e1ximo de 10 horas sin compromiso.\\n[*] Cada mes habr\\u00e1 nuevas recompensas en los t\\u00edtulos m\\u00e1s populares de EA, incluidos elementos cosm\\u00e9ticos, paquetes de puntos y m\\u00e1s.\\n[*] Un descuento del 10\\u00a0% en compras de contenido digital de EA, incluidos juegos completos, paquetes de puntos y DLC.\\n[\\\/list]\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u00bfC\\u00f3mo puedo unirme a EA Play?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEs muy sencillo, solo tienes que registrarte. Sigue las instrucciones en pantalla y podr\\u00e1s sumergirte en un mundo de juegos al instante. Tambi\\u00e9n puedes unirte directamente desde la tienda de tu plataforma favorita.\\u00a0\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u00bfQu\\u00e9 juegos consigo con EA Play?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nSi eres miembro, obtienes acceso ilimitado a The Play List, una colecci\\u00f3n de los mejores t\\u00edtulos de EA que incluyen franquicias como Battlefield\\u2122, EA SPORTS FC\\u2122, F1\\u00ae, Madden NFL, Los Sims\\u2122, STAR WARS\\u2122 y muchos m\\u00e1s. Tambi\\u00e9n podr\\u00e1s jugar a pruebas de una selecci\\u00f3n de t\\u00edtulos nuevos de EA durante un m\\u00e1ximo de 10 horas. La disponibilidad de t\\u00edtulos var\\u00eda en funci\\u00f3n de la plataforma.\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u00bfQu\\u00e9 es The Play List?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nThe Play List es nuestra colecci\\u00f3n de juegos incre\\u00edbles incluida en tu membres\\u00eda, con los nuevos \\u00e9xitos, los favoritos del p\\u00fablico y mucho m\\u00e1s. Todas las versiones completas se destinan a que juegues todo lo que quieras, con m\\u00e1s t\\u00edtulos a\\u00f1adidos constantemente. Echa un vistazo aqu\\u00ed a todos los juegos de The Play List.\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u00bfPor qu\\u00e9 var\\u00edan los juegos de The Play List de unos pa\\u00edses a otros?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nLa respuesta corta es que cada pa\\u00eds tiene una normativa diferente sobre qu\\u00e9 juegos pueden venderse o ponerse a disposici\\u00f3n. Como resultado, los juegos que veas en The Play List pueden variar un poco seg\\u00fan la ubicaci\\u00f3n.\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u00bfPuedo seguir jugando a los juegos despu\\u00e9s del periodo de prueba?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nCuando concluya tu periodo de prueba, tendr\\u00e1s que comprar el juego si quieres seguir disfrutando de \\u00e9l.\\n\\n[h1][b]Si juego a una prueba de EA Play, \\u00bfconservar\\u00e9 mi progreso?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nS\\u00ed, una vez que termine tu prueba limitada de los \\u00faltimos juegos de EA, tu progreso se mantendr\\u00e1. Despu\\u00e9s, podr\\u00e1s continuar donde lo dejaste si decides comprar el juego.\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u00bfQu\\u00e9 descuentos tengo con mi membres\\u00eda?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nComo miembro de EA Play, obtendr\\u00e1s autom\\u00e1ticamente un descuento del 10\\u00a0% en compras digitales de EA desde la plataforma a la que tengas acceso a EA Play, incluidos nuevos lanzamientos, reservas, expansiones, paquetes de juego, puntos... Lo que se te ocurra. Recuerda: aunque EA Play est\\u00e9 disponible para distintas plataformas, el descuento solo se aplica a la plataforma en la que te hayas unido. Por ejemplo, si te has unido en Epic Games Store, tus compras digitales de EA en esta plataforma recibir\\u00e1n un descuento del 10\\u00a0%. Si te has unido en Xbox, tus compras digitales de EA para Xbox recibir\\u00e1n el 10\\u00a0% de descuento.\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u00bfEn qu\\u00e9 plataformas est\\u00e1 EA Play est\\u00e1 disponible?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEA Play est\\u00e1 disponible para Xbox, PlayStation\\u00ae, PC a trav\\u00e9s de Epic Games Store, la EA app, Steam y Mac a trav\\u00e9s de la EA app. Ten en cuenta que aunque EA Play est\\u00e9 disponible para distintas plataformas, tu membres\\u00eda est\\u00e1 vinculada a la plataforma en la que te hayas unido. Si te has unido en PlayStation\\u00ae, tu Play List, el descuento de miembros y el resto de ventajas solo estar\\u00e1n disponibles aqu\\u00ed.\\u00a0\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u00bfPuedo jugar a t\\u00edtulos de EA Play en Mac?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nPor supuesto. EA Play ya est\\u00e1 disponible para Mac a trav\\u00e9s de la EA app.\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u00bfQu\\u00e9 m\\u00e9todos de pago puedo utilizar para comprar una membres\\u00eda de EA Play?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEn funci\\u00f3n de tu ubicaci\\u00f3n, podr\\u00e1s utilizar una tarjeta de cr\\u00e9dito, PayPal o monedero de la plataforma (consulta las pesta\\u00f1as de la plataforma para acceder a los m\\u00e9todos de pago adicionales). Ten en cuenta que no todos los m\\u00e9todos de pago est\\u00e1n disponibles en todas las regiones.\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u00bfCu\\u00e1nto cuesta EA Play?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nUna membres\\u00eda de EA Play cuesta solo 5,99\\u00a0\\u20ac al mes, o puedes ahorrar a\\u00fan m\\u00e1s si te suscribes por 39,99\\u00a0\\u20ac al a\\u00f1o completo. \\u00a1Y con tu 10\\u00a0% de descuento, la membres\\u00eda pr\\u00e1cticamente se paga sola si compras un solo juego!\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u00bfQu\\u00e9 pasa si quiero cancelar EA Play antes de que acabe mi membres\\u00eda?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nSi cancelas la membres\\u00eda antes de la pr\\u00f3xima fecha de facturaci\\u00f3n mensual o anual, no se te cargar\\u00e1 el siguiente mes o a\\u00f1o. Seguir\\u00e1s teniendo acceso para jugar a los t\\u00edtulos, podr\\u00e1s utilizar tu descuento y probar las pruebas disponibles hasta que caduque la membres\\u00eda.\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u00bfC\\u00f3mo cancelo mi membres\\u00eda de EA Play?[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nCancelar tu membres\\u00eda de EA Play es sencillo y no supone ning\\u00fan problema. Selecciona la pesta\\u00f1a de la plataforma con la que te has registrado en EA Play y sigue las instrucciones.\\n\\n\\n\&quot;,\&quot;[h1][b]\\u4ec0\\u4e48\\u662f EA Play*\\uff1f[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nEA Play \\u662f EA \\u6e38\\u620f\\u7c89\\u4e1d\\u7684\\u7ec8\\u6781\\u6e38\\u620f\\u4f1a\\u5458\\u8d44\\u683c\\u3002\\u901a\\u8fc7 EA Play\\uff0c\\u60a8\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u65e0\\u9650\\u7545\\u73a9\\u4e00\\u7cfb\\u5217\\u5907\\u53d7\\u559c\\u7231\\u7684 Electronic Arts \\u6e38\\u620f\\uff0c\\u4f53\\u9a8c\\u7cbe\\u9009\\u65b0\\u4f5c\\u7684\\u8bd5\\u73a9\\u7248\\uff0c\\u83b7\\u53d6\\u6bcf\\u6708\\u4f1a\\u5458\\u5956\\u52b1\\u7b49\\u2014\\u2014\\u4ec5\\u9700\\u6bcf\\u6708 5.99 \\u7f8e\\u5143\\u6216\\u6bcf\\u5e74 39.99 \\u7f8e\\u5143\\u3002\\n\\n[u]\\u5305\\u542b\\u5185\\u5bb9\\uff1a[\\\/u]\\n[list]\\n[*] \\u65e0\\u9650\\u7545\\u73a9 EA \\u7c89\\u4e1d\\u6700\\u7231\\u7684\\u7cfb\\u5217\\u6e38\\u620f\\u548c\\u9876\\u7ea7\\u4f5c\\u54c1\\uff0c\\u5c3d\\u4eab\\u65e0\\u4e0e\\u4f26\\u6bd4\\u7684\\u6e38\\u620f\\u6536\\u85cf\\u3002\\n[*] \\u8bd5\\u73a9\\u7cbe\\u9009\\u65b0\\u4f5c\\u6700\\u591a 10 \\u5c0f\\u65f6\\uff0c\\u65e0\\u9700\\u4efb\\u4f55\\u82b1\\u8d39\\u3002\\n[*] \\u6bcf\\u6708\\u83b7\\u53d6 EA \\u70ed\\u95e8\\u6e38\\u620f\\u7684\\u5168\\u65b0\\u5956\\u52b1\\uff0c\\u5305\\u62ec\\u88c5\\u626e\\u7269\\u54c1\\u3001\\u70b9\\u6570\\u7ec4\\u5408\\u5305\\u7b49\\u3002\\n[*] \\u8d2d\\u4e70 EA \\u6570\\u5b57\\u5185\\u5bb9\\uff08\\u5305\\u62ec\\u5b8c\\u6574\\u6e38\\u620f\\u3001\\u70b9\\u6570\\u7ec4\\u5408\\u5305\\u548c DLC \\u7b49\\uff09\\u53ef\\u4eab\\u53d7\\u4e5d\\u6298\\u4f18\\u60e0\\u3002\\n[\\\/list]\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u5982\\u4f55\\u52a0\\u5165 EA Play\\uff1f[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\n\\u5f88\\u7b80\\u5355\\u2014\\u2014\\u60a8\\u9700\\u8981\\u505a\\u7684\\u5c31\\u662f\\u6ce8\\u518c\\u3002\\u53ea\\u9700\\u6309\\u7167\\u5c4f\\u5e55\\u4e0a\\u7684\\u6307\\u793a\\uff0c\\u60a8\\u5c31\\u80fd\\u9a6c\\u4e0a\\u8fdb\\u5165\\u6e38\\u620f\\u3002\\u60a8\\u4e5f\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u5728\\u60a8\\u504f\\u597d\\u5e73\\u53f0\\u4e0a\\u7684\\u5546\\u5e97\\u4e2d\\u76f4\\u63a5\\u52a0\\u5165\\u3002\\u00a0\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u6211\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u901a\\u8fc7 EA Play \\u83b7\\u5f97\\u54ea\\u4e9b\\u6e38\\u620f\\uff1f[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\n\\u4f1a\\u5458\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u65e0\\u9650\\u7545\\u73a9 The Play List \\u4e2d\\u7684\\u9876\\u7ea7 EA \\u6e38\\u620f\\uff0c\\u5305\\u62ec\\u300a\\u6218\\u5730\\u98ce\\u4e91\\u2122\\u300b\\u3001\\u300aEA SPORTS FC\\u2122\\u300b\\u3001\\u300aF1\\u00ae\\u300b\\u3001\\u300aMadden NFL\\u300b\\u3001\\u300a\\u6a21\\u62df\\u4eba\\u751f\\u2122\\u300b\\u548c\\u300a\\u661f\\u7403\\u5927\\u6218\\u2122\\u300b\\u7b49\\u4f17\\u591a\\u7cfb\\u5217\\u4f5c\\u54c1\\u3002\\u4f1a\\u5458\\u8fd8\\u53ef\\u8bd5\\u73a9\\u7cbe\\u9009\\u65b0\\u4f5c\\u6700\\u591a 10 \\u5c0f\\u65f6\\u3002\\u8bf7\\u6ce8\\u610f\\uff0c\\u6e38\\u620f\\u56e0\\u5e73\\u53f0\\u800c\\u5f02\\u3002\\n\\n[h1][b]The Play List \\u662f\\u4ec0\\u4e48\\uff1f[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\nThe Play List \\u662f\\u6211\\u4eec\\u7684\\u7cbe\\u9009\\u6e38\\u620f\\u5408\\u96c6\\uff0c\\u5305\\u542b\\u4e86\\u5168\\u65b0\\u70ed\\u95e8\\u6e38\\u620f\\u3001\\u7c89\\u4e1d\\u6700\\u7231\\u4ee5\\u53ca\\u66f4\\u591a\\u7cbe\\u5f69\\u5185\\u5bb9\\u2014\\u2014\\u6240\\u6709\\u8fd9\\u4e9b\\u90fd\\u5305\\u542b\\u5728\\u60a8\\u7684\\u4f1a\\u5458\\u8d44\\u683c\\u4e2d\\u3002\\u60a8\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u5c3d\\u60c5\\u7545\\u73a9\\u6240\\u6709\\u5b8c\\u6574\\u7248\\u6e38\\u620f\\uff0c\\u800c\\u4e14\\u6211\\u4eec\\u4f1a\\u4e0d\\u65ad\\u6dfb\\u52a0\\u66f4\\u591a\\u6e38\\u620f\\u3002\\u5728\\u6b64\\u67e5\\u770b The Play List \\u4e0a\\u7684\\u6240\\u6709\\u6e38\\u620f\\u3002\\n\\n[h1][b]The Play List \\u4e2d\\u7684\\u6e38\\u620f\\u4e3a\\u4ec0\\u4e48\\u4f1a\\u56e0\\u56fd\\u5bb6\\u6216\\u5730\\u533a\\u800c\\u4e0d\\u540c\\uff1f[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\n\\u7b80\\u800c\\u8a00\\u4e4b\\uff1a\\u4e0d\\u540c\\u56fd\\u5bb6\\u6216\\u5730\\u533a\\u5bf9\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u51fa\\u552e\\u6216\\u63d0\\u4f9b\\u7684\\u6e38\\u620f\\u6709\\u4e0d\\u540c\\u7684\\u89c4\\u5219\\u3002\\u56e0\\u6b64\\uff0c\\u8fd9\\u610f\\u5473\\u7740\\u60a8\\u5728 The Play List \\u4e2d\\u770b\\u5230\\u7684\\u6e38\\u620f\\u53ef\\u80fd\\u4f1a\\u56e0\\u5730\\u533a\\u8bbe\\u7f6e\\u800c\\u7565\\u6709\\u4e0d\\u540c\\u3002\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u6211\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u5728\\u8bd5\\u73a9\\u671f\\u540e\\u7ee7\\u7eed\\u6e38\\u73a9\\u6e38\\u620f\\u5417\\uff1f[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\n\\u8bd5\\u73a9\\u7ed3\\u675f\\u540e\\uff0c\\u5982\\u679c\\u60a8\\u60f3\\u7ee7\\u7eed\\u6e38\\u73a9\\uff0c\\u9700\\u8d2d\\u4e70\\u8be5\\u6e38\\u620f\\u3002\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u5982\\u679c\\u6211\\u73a9\\u7684\\u662f EA Play \\u6e38\\u620f\\u8bd5\\u73a9\\u7248\\uff0c\\u6211\\u7684\\u8fdb\\u5ea6\\u80fd\\u4fdd\\u5b58\\u5417\\uff1f[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\n\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\uff0c\\u5728\\u6700\\u65b0\\u7684 EA \\u6e38\\u620f\\u9650\\u65f6\\u8bd5\\u73a9\\u7ed3\\u675f\\u540e\\uff0c\\u60a8\\u7684\\u8fdb\\u5ea6\\u5c06\\u4f1a\\u4fdd\\u7559\\u3002\\u5982\\u679c\\u60a8\\u51b3\\u5b9a\\u8d2d\\u4e70\\u6e38\\u620f\\uff0c\\u5373\\u53ef\\u4ece\\u4e0a\\u6b21\\u9000\\u51fa\\u7684\\u5730\\u65b9\\u7ee7\\u7eed\\u6e38\\u620f\\u3002\\n\\n[h1][b]\\u54ea\\u4e9b\\u5730\\u65b9\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u4f7f\\u7528\\u6211\\u7684\\u4f1a\\u5458\\u6298\\u6263\\uff1f[\\\/b][\\\/h1]\\n\\u4f5c\\u4e3a EA Play \\u4f1a\\u5458\\uff0c\\u60a8\\u5c06\\u5728\\u60a8\\u6240\\u4f7f\\u7528\\u7684 EA Play \\u5e73\\u53f0\\u4e0a\\u8d2d\\u4e70 EA \\u6570\\u5b57\\u5546\\u54c1\\u65f6\\uff0c\\u81ea\\u52a8\\u4eab\\u53d7\\u4e5d\\u6298\\u4f18\\u60e0\\uff0c\\u5305\\u62ec\\u65b0\\u6e38\\u620f\\u3001\\u9884\\u8d2d\\u3001\\u6269\\u5c55\\u5305\\u3001\\u6e38\\u620f\\u7ec4\\u5408\\u5305\\u3001\\u70b9\\u6570\\u7b49\\u3002\\u6ce8\\u610f\\uff1a\\u867d\\u7136 EA Play \\u53ef\\u5728\\u591a\\u4e2a\\u5e73\\u53f0\\u4e0a\\u4f7f\\u7528\\uff0c\\u4f46\\u60a8\\u4ec5\\u53ef\\u5728\\u60a8\\u52a0\\u5165\\u7684\\u5e73\\u53f0\\u83b7\\u5f97\\u6298\\u6263\\u3002\\u4f8b\\u5982\\uff0c\\u5982\\u679c\\u60a8\\u901a\\u8fc7 Epic Games Store \\u52a0\\u5165\\uff0c\\u60a8